          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu wakadya mbiji yawu akakosi yuma yindi yakuvwala akekali wamajilu hohu nikumelela; hela yena wakasenda akakosi yuma yindi yakuvwala, akekali wamajilu hohu nikumelela.",
          "type": "text",
